{"c":"401225","n":"VODNÍ NÁDRŽ REZERVO","t":"M","s":"PHA","o":"Územní svaz města Prahy","url":"401225-vodni-nadrz-rezervo-401225-vplu","stav":"2026-10-10","popis":"GPS 49°42‘25.674“N, 13°58‘43.751“E\nLov ryb povolen pouze z hráze a z části levého břehu nádrže od konce hráze až k hraniční tabuli. Lov přívlačí je povolen pouze na umělou nástrahu v době od 16. 6. do 31. 12. Dravé ryby (štika, candát) jsou hájeny od 1. 1. do 31. 8. Kapr nemá na této nádrži stanovenou nejmenší lovnou míru. Denní\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\núlovek kapra není omezen počtem kusů ani hmotností. Denní úlovek bílé ryby (plotice, perlín, cejnek malý) není omezen hmotností. Zákaz vnadění a používání krmítek.","delka":0,"rozloha":2,"lat":49.70713,"lon":13.97882,"mo_web":"http://www.rybaripraha.cz/","mo_tel":"222 248 109, 222 248 110","mo_mail":"info@rybaripraha.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-09-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":0,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":n